WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.500
A skill arrived. Its checklist did not.
One explicit local reference; its target is missing. No skill is executed.

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:15.000
Keep the finding before changing files.
Download the local resource report. It records the referenced path and its status.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:22.500
Restore the file. Check the folder again.
The target is now present. Availability does not establish instruction quality.

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:30.000
Make the same finding a CI gate.
The quickstart runs the published CLI: missing target → exit 1; restored target → exit 0.
